==Prices==
The cost of seeds, [[Grass Starter]], [[Sugar]], [[Wheat Flour]], and [[Rice]] at JojaMart are higher than at [[Pierre's General Store]], with one exception: [[Sunflower Seeds]] are {{Price|125}} at JojaMart, and {{Price|200}} at Pierre's. After the player purchases a Joja membership, prices are the same as at Pierre's (with the exception of Sunflower Seeds, which sell for {{Price|100}} at Joja).

The prices of [[Joja Cola]], the [[J. Cola Light]], [[Wallpaper]] (including Joja wallpaper) and [[Flooring]] do not change after purchasing a Joja membership.

